## 2. Why levels are not usable
ADF (maxlag=2): LMC gni_pc level ADF=+2.97 p=1.000; LMC edu p=0.739; LMC sec p=0.989; SSF edu p=0.539; SSF sec p=0.870. First log-differences stationary (LMC gni p=0.022, LMC edu p<0.001, SSF edu p=0.007). AR(1) levels: gni 0.998, sec 0.998, prim 0.99. First differences are therefore the primary transformation.

